        Root cause:
        The bug arises from the validation of the block size in the configuration space of the virtio block device, which is problematic for big endian guests when accessing config space before completing feature negotiation. This leads to boot failures for virtual machines, particularly because the validation logic was incomplete and did not account for the necessary checks on block size being a power of two.

